Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 15:12:36 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Fix LIVE miss: arm pipeline on fresh HF<1 despite watchlist
 stale-critical.

Under event-purity + Flashblocks, fullSweeps are disabled so staleness age can
grow past critical and abort runOnce before liquidation_evaluated. Upsert the
confirmed candidate into the hybrid cache, mark watchlist fresh, heartbeat
staleness on flashblock ticks, and allow a candidate-path-only stale-critical
bypass so profit/debt gates still run.
